				<a href="https://lz.lbl.gov/" aria-current="page" rel="home"><img src="https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1.jpg" width="2000" height="727" alt="The LZ Dark Matter Experiment" class="header-image" srcset="https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1.jpg 2000w, https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1-300x109.jpg 300w, https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1-1024x372.jpg 1024w, https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1-768x279.jpg 768w, https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1-1536x558.jpg 1536w, https://lz.lbl.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/07/cropped-ScanningForDust_TPC_Crop-scaled-1-624x227.jpg 624w" sizes="(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></a>
